WCH-derived first-party modifications
-------------------------------------

firmware/ch592/src/startup_CH592_phased.S is a modified copy of the WCH CH592
SDK startup file. firmware/ch570/link.ld and firmware/ch592/link.ld are based
on the corresponding WCH SDK linker scripts. These files identify their
modifications and are distributed under Apache-2.0 while retaining WCH
provenance. The upstream startup file states:

  Attention: This software (modified or not) and binary are used for
  microcontroller manufactured by Nanjing Qinheng Microelectronics.

OpenDongle targets WCH CH570 and CH592 microcontrollers and complies with that
stated use condition.
